From 7ee5c9c2f2b59e1e97e49f9519649bc42c88b2db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hunt-abl-gouraud <mreverssci@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:46:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] probe(gouraud): dispatch census + two ablation rungs

Not shippable. HUNTCEN_GOURAUD counts where gouraud faces go and what
disqualifies one from the asm; HUNTABL_NOGOURAUD drops every gouraud face at
the raster dispatch; HUNTABL_GNULL keeps the whole call chain and stubs only
the kernel body. All three names avoid the strings src/makefile greps for, so
the four handrolled asm kernels stay in the link.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
