 3rd/toridraw/graphics/raster/gouraud_census.h | 133 ++++++++++++++++++
 3rd/toridraw/toridraw_raster.u.c              |  21 +++
 3rd/toridraw/toridraw_unity.c                 |   2 +
 .../triangles/toridraw_triangle_gouraud.u.c   |  23 +++
 7 files changed, 372 insertions(+)
